---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const itemSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": "Side Salad",
      "image": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/Images/side-salad.webp",
      "description": "Fresh mixed greens, cherry tomatoes, and croutons served with your choice of dressing. At 90 calories, the lightest item on the DQ menu — the right side when you want something fresh.",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "3.29",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
        "url": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/items/side-salad"
      },
      "nutrition": {
        "@type": "NutritionInformation",
        "calories": "90 cal (without dressing)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much is the DQ Side Salad?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "$3.29 with 90 calories before dressing. Adding Ranch dressing adds approximately 140 calories; lighter vinaigrette options add approximately 40–60 calories."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What comes in the DQ Side Salad?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mixed greens, cherry tomatoes, and croutons. Dressing is served on the side."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is the DQ Side Salad available everywhere?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The Side Salad is available at DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations. DQ Treat-only locations do not serve salads."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Side Salad — Price, Calories 2026" description="DQ Side Salad price: $3.29, 90 calories. Mixed greens, tomatoes, and croutons with dressing. The lightest item on the DQ menu — available at Grill & Chill...">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(itemSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><div class="container"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li><li><a href="/categories/snacks-sides">Snacks &amp; Sides</a></li><li aria-current="page">Side Salad</li></ol></div></nav>

<div class="container">
  <div class="item-hero">
    <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/side-salad.webp" alt="Side Salad — Dairy Queen 2026 menu item" width="600" height="450" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge red">Lightest DQ Item</span><span class="badge">90 Calories</span><span class="badge blue">Dressing Included</span></div>
      <h1>Side Salad</h1>
      <div class="item-price-lg">$3.29</div>
      <p>The definitive wellness option on Dairy Queen's savory board, the DQ Side Salad features a crisp foundation of shredded iceberg and romaine lettuce, ripe sweet grape tomatoes, and crunchy seasoned garlic croutons, served with dressing on the side. Delivering refreshing crunch for just 90 calories (before dressing) at $3.29.</p>

      <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Price</td><td>$3.29</td></tr><tr><td>Calories</td><td>90 cal (without dressing)</td></tr><tr><td>Total Fat</td><td>3g (without dressing)</td></tr><tr><td>Contents</td><td>Mixed greens, cherry tomatoes, croutons, dressing</td></tr><tr><td>Available At</td><td>DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Price &amp; Calories — 2026</h2>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Size / Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Total Fat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Side Salad</strong></td><td>$3.29</td><td class="price-cell">90 cal</td><td>3g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Regular Fries (small)</strong></td><td>$2.49</td><td class="price-cell">260 cal</td><td>12g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Onion Rings</strong></td><td>$3.29+</td><td class="price-cell">400+ cal</td><td>~20g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cheese Curds</strong></td><td>$3.99</td><td class="price-cell">470 cal</td><td>28g</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Prices are 2026 national averages. Local DQ prices may vary.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>The DQ Side Salad: Fast-Food Freshness and Caloric Balance</h2>
    <p>While Dairy Queen's culinary fame is built on indulgent soft serve sundaes and savory flame-broiled Stackburgers, the <strong>Side Salad</strong> serves as an essential option for mindful diners. At just 90 calories before dressing, it provides a crisp, cooling alternative to deep-fried sides like French fries or cheese curds. Packed with fresh chilled romaine and iceberg lettuce, plump grape tomatoes, and baked herb croutons, it offers dietary fiber, vitamin A, and hydration without sodium heaviness. Available exclusively at DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations. Explore all savory options on <a href="/categories/snacks-sides">Snacks &amp; Sides</a> or compare full menus on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

    <h2>Dressing Calorie Breakdown</h2>
    <p>Because the base salad is exceptionally light, your dressing selection determines the final nutritional profile:</p>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Dressing Option</th><th>Serving Added Cal</th><th>Total Salad Cal</th><th>Nutritional Character</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>No Dressing (Plain)</strong></td><td>0 cal</td><td>90 cal</td><td>Pure crisp hydration and fresh fiber</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Fat-Free Italian</strong></td><td>~40 cal</td><td>~130 cal</td><td>Tangy vinegar and herb blend</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Balsamic Vinaigrette</strong></td><td>~60 cal</td><td>~150 cal</td><td>Rich sweet-tart balance with olive oil</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Classic Creamy Ranch</strong></td><td>~140 cal</td><td>~230 cal</td><td>Traditional buttermilk and dill richness</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>Building Sub-600 Calorie DQ Combos</h2>
    <p>Replacing standard French fries with the Side Salad unlocks nutritious, balanced meal combinations under 600 total calories:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>The Lean Poultry Combo:</strong> Pair a <a href="/items/grilled-chicken-sandwich">Grilled Chicken Sandwich</a> (390 cal) with a Side Salad dressed in light Italian (~130 cal) for a high-protein 520-calorie meal.</li>
      <li><strong>The Classic Burger Swap:</strong> Pair an <a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger</a> (400 cal) with an undressed Side Salad (90 cal) for an authentic diner burger meal clocking in at only 490 calories.</li>
      <li><strong>Full Meal Upgrade:</strong> If you desire a salad as your primary entrée rather than a side, inquire about the <strong>Crispy Chicken Strips Salad Bowl</strong> ($9.49, ~470 cal).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is the DQ Side Salad?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">$3.29 with 90 calories before dressing. Adding Ranch dressing adds approximately 140 calories; lighter vinaigrette options add approximately 40–60 calories.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What comes in the DQ Side Salad?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Mixed greens, cherry tomatoes, and croutons. Dressing is served on the side.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is the DQ Side Salad available everywhere?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The Side Salad is available at DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations. DQ Treat-only locations do not serve salads.</div></div>
    </div></div>

    <h2 style="margin-top:40px;">Related Healthy Sides &amp; Light Entrees</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/items/grilled-chicken-sandwich">Grilled Chicken Sandwich — 390 calories, high protein</a></li>
      <li><a href="/items/regular-fries">DQ Regular French Fries — $2.49+</a></li>
      <li><a href="/items/pretzel-sticks-queso">Soft Pretzel Sticks with Queso — $3.99</a></li>
      <li><a href="/categories/snacks-sides">All Dairy Queen Snacks &amp; Sides</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:28px;">For the complete 2026 DQ food, treats, and drink menu, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

